      "id": "2121464072386568292",
      "text": "#NYR Glenn Gawdin scored his first two career NHL goals tonight. He’s was born 33 minutes from Vancouver in Richmond, BC. That’s the dream right there. A 5-1 win and a 3-1 road trip for the Blueshirts.",
