      "author": "Matthew Mugno",
      "handle": "mugnoma",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2054583490922848256/7Lzullo0_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Tonight, #NYR Glenn Gawdin will play his first NHL game since 2023-24. The Richmond, BC native was drafted by STL 116th OVA in the 2015 draft. After winning a WHL championship in 2018, he began his pro-career with the Stockton Heat (AHL). The 29-year old has skated in 13 NHL",
      "quoted_author": "Matthew Mugno",
      "quoted_handle": "mugnoma"
    },
